Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.53,0:00:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The time of my reign has finally begun!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.85,0:00:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Miss Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.31,0:00:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand your position?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.47,0:00:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.92,0:00:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm {\i1}your ruler{\i0} now!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, you're not!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.32,0:00:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got them to accept her succession.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If she gets killed, it'll all be for nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.17,0:00:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}And she makes a better figurehead if she's a bit dim.{Wasn't sure if I should change figurehead to puppet here so I puppet ruler could be used in subsequent lines. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.59,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the figurehead{see above} ruler!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.64,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A shiny, pretty figurehead.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.50,0:00:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The repairs to Yamato Palace are coming along well.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.95,0:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be finished in time for Imagawa's succession.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I've had to leave that to you when you're just back from battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, there's something that bothers me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.57,0:00:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where Matsunaga Danjo is.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.69,0:00:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think she ran with Miyoshi to Shikoku?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.33,0:01:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.11,0:01:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But she can't do anything on her own.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't think so, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.54,0:01:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What upsets me more is Mitsuhide!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.10,0:01:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go already.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheating is wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.37,0:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Juubei{-chan} was just too serious and stubborn about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.09,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you really want to defend her.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.11,0:01:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, already. She didn't mean anything wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.11,0:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too naïve, Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.69,0:01:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.92,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,751)}If she keeps getting isolated...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The more serious someone is,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the more likely they are to do something when they snap.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.01,0:01:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,223)}I have to stop the Honnouji event, no matter what.{\i0}
