Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.90,0:03:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your head.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.64,0:03:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only a game.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.22,0:03:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.53,0:03:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You overdid it a little, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.09,0:03:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you apologize to Sagara?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.61,0:03:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}In a battle for promotion, there's no point if you don't win.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.96,0:03:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.82,0:03:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,To the princess, her retainers are like family.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she want to see them fighting
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.34,0:03:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,each other and trying to put each other down?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.70,0:03:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The only family {\i1}I{\i0} have is my mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.66,0:03:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Family and retainers are different.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.41,0:03:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just because you were lucky.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.77,0:04:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were loved by a wise mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.40,0:04:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not hated as the princess was.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.55,0:04:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that just a rumor?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.97,0:04:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.59,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I won!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Nobuna, protected Owari!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.10,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you appear before your mother dressed in such wretched clothing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a princess of the Oda clan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.87,0:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.23,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's so cheerful.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.87,0:04:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants to keep everyone from worrying, I'd imagine.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.45,0:04:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To her, you and Sagara{-han} are her family.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.95,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.27,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.67,0:04:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeda and Uesugi have stopped fighting over
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.74,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawanakajima and made peace.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.27,0:04:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.86,0:05:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.40,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They must've decided that
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,with Nobuna in the capital, it wasn't time to fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that Takeda and Uesugi have joined forces.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.40,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And that they have 50,000 soldiers.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.16,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.23,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw all of our forces to Gifu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.55,0:05:15.04,Alt,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.04,0:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeda and Uesugi can't join forces. It's impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it happened!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.77,0:05:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It is indeed true that they made peace in Kawanakajima.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Yamamoto Kansuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.80,0:05:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kitsutsuki Strategy failed, and Shingen's brother died, too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.76,0:05:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Takeda's and Uesugi's armies are unharmed.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.43,0:05:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We've confirmed it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.25,0:05:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.49,0:05:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is history starting to drift away from what I know?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.29,0:05:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you saved me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.07,0:05:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to die at Magaragawa, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.69,0:05:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did {\i0}I{\i1} do it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.96,0:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I change history?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I can't tell the future anymore,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,894)}can I still help her?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.89,0:06:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll have to believe in myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.17,0:06:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My soul as a Sengoku Era sim gamer is ringing alarm bells.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.35,0:06:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A Takeda-Uesugi army is impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.06,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't turn back!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.63,0:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Owari and Mino between us and them.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.15,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it to the capital
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and are about to establish a new regime.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.88,0:06:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is seeing whether Oda Nobuna is fit to rule Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All forces withdraw.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.72,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my decision.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.25,0:06:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are people out there who believe in you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.07,0:06:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That you'll be the one to create a new era.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the time to stand firm?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Viper is...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,in Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.15,0:06:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother's in Owari.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.18,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rule Japan if I abandon the people I care about.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand... I understand, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.87,0:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.13,0:06:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd hear you say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.05,0:06:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that at least you would be different!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.31,0:06:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to send the person who
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,lost the takoyaki match to the Gifu Castle dungeons.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.65,0:07:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.63,0:07:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see you ever again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The main Oda force
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.35,0:07:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,began to turn back down the Eastern Sea Road
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.63,0:07:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}with Shibata Katsuie and Niwa Nagahide in the lead.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.27,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving only Imagawa Yoshimoto and a small guard in Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.79,0:07:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Fool Princess fell for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.42,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the area around Kyo is essentially abandoned.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Danjo's turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.31,0:07:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My forces are already lying in wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.94,0:07:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't kill Imagawa Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.03,0:07:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send her to you unharmed.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.03,0:07:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Akechi Mitsuhide is rather attractive herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.28,0:07:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl Tsuda{-dono} is using, you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.38,0:07:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my eye on her as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.62,0:08:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the Oda girls are very beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.15,0:08:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When they join in,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.20,0:08:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,my Tale of Genji will be all the more splendid.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone else have her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.93,0:08:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hikaru Genji of this age is very greedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way to Echizen, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.93,0:08:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the capital as soon as you can, Yoshikage{-dono}.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.75,0:08:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope you can actually
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.42,0:08:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}get Takeda and Uesugi to do something next time, Advisor Konoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.03,0:08:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.41,0:08:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that perverted count!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.58,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All you'll get is Nobuna's corpse!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.77,0:08:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought at least you would be different!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's really just an ordinary girl.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.62,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A crybaby who wants her family to love her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.93,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should know that better than anyone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.31,0:09:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(0,811)}And all I thought of was what Oda Nobuna the General should do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to get a hold of myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.74,0:09:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to do more than just let her rule Japan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.09,0:09:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being a demon wouldn't suit her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.12,0:09:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.95,0:09:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you want to rule Japan,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}isn't this the time to stand firm?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.39,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, dummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.75,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you call me, Lord Nobuna?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.57,0:09:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your forces are to stay and protect Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshimoto's, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.57,0:09:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.64,0:09:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you do hate me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.64,0:09:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's about to declare her appointment.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take her back with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.54,0:10:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And Monkey's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.76,0:10:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to rule Japan,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't abandon Kyo, no matter what.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.39,0:10:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend it with your life until I get back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.69,0:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, have you seen Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.85,0:10:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.25,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu's been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidnapped?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.75,0:10:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone saw somebody carrying what looked like Mr. Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.98,0:10:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.05,0:10:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.32,0:10:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you kidnap me?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.66,0:10:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As bait.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.34,0:10:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bait to bring in Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You plan to assassinate her? Who put you up to this?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.44,0:11:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay put.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the target's dead, I'll kill you, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.54,0:11:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna won't come out here—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna has left.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.79,0:11:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm all alone here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.23,0:11:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All I can do now is the job I've been given.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.77,0:11:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I, Akechi Juubei Mitsuhide, shall protect Kyo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.33,0:11:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Goemon, where's Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.06,0:11:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone said they saw him on the way to Oumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.46,0:11:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay safe, Monkey.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't apologized to you yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll pay you three times what you're getting.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have fame than money.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.30,0:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kill Oda Nobuna, the one on the verge of uniting Japan,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.12,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Sugitani Zenjuubou, shall be famous throughout the land.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.54,0:12:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If she dies, it'll take 100 more years to unite Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.69,0:12:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.82,0:12:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If Japan is united and at peace, people like me are out of a job.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.51,0:12:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,People who, like me, love this chaotic civil war age.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.49,0:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Oda's main forces were heading to south Oumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.78,0:12:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Takeda and Uesugi aren't doing anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that they made peace at Kawanakajima.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.96,0:12:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of it is all lies, I believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.67,0:12:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.94,0:12:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap to draw Oda's forces away from Kyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.73,0:12:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Matsunaga's forces number 3000.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe they're going after Yoshimoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.94,0:12:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they get here?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.41,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our forces number 800.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.67,0:12:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to make them siege us.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a temple!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.31,0:12:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to buy time until Lord Nobuna gets back.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.58,0:12:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Close all the doors and focus on defense!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.58,0:12:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Mitsuhide{-san}!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.62,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Mother, the only good thing is that Lord Nobuna left this place.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.94,0:13:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that a person's smile
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.16,0:13:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,is most beautiful when they've accepted death.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.85,0:13:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.01,0:13:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Matsunaga Danjo Hisahide.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.01,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an enemy general doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.37,0:13:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to kill a beautiful girl like you myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.73,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My spear techniques are of the Houzouin-style.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.21,0:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna's retainer, Akechi Juubei Mitsuhide:
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.70,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,a master of the Kashima Shintou-Style.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.79,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.68,0:13:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it! Because of me, Nobuna...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey's up there?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.04,0:14:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you could have Japan for yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.31,0:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you just one of Oda Nobuna's retainers?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.57,0:14:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's{\i0} the one who is fit to rule Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.28,0:14:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've bet my dreams on her!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.35,0:14:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams are a fragile thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.43,0:14:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stand here talking to you all day.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.51,0:14:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful, intelligent, noble,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.74,0:14:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,with a burning dream...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.16,0:14:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I meet someone like you,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.57,0:14:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help myself...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.81,0:14:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.49,0:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The despair on your face when your dream falls apart...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.45,0:14:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.31,0:15:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, the stage is prepared.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.35,0:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us kill each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.31,0:15:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay back. Stay away!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.02,0:15:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't there anything I can do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.45,0:15:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it turns on for even an instant...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Save Nobuna for me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.73,0:15:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.65,0:15:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.33,0:16:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't lose to an illusion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.73,0:16:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wonderful!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.19,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if, after all this effort,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,your beloved Lord Nobuna was already dead?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.41,0:16:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody hired an assassin.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.21,0:16:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably been shot by now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.64,0:16:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.94,0:16:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna's dead?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dead...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.11,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Once there's an opening into their heart,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,people are so fragile.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.95,0:16:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Juubei!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.76,0:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.04,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.84,0:17:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Saved at the last second.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.97,0:17:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugitani Zenjuubou escaped, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And so we ran back here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with just the five of us,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we're more than enough reinforcement!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happens to Lord Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She made that decision herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.87,0:17:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Juubei can be a little close-minded,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.40,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's part of my family, and shares my dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.03,0:17:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.79,0:17:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.58,0:17:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}is{\i0} a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.13,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no dream!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.94,0:18:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey Man!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.01,0:18:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.15,0:18:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you did to Mr. Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.45,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you save me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.95,0:18:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you believe in Nobuna?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.70,0:18:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.66,0:18:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs you!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.26,0:18:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever find yourself uncertain in the future, remember...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the image of Kiyomizu Temple burning,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and how Nobuna appeared!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.31,0:18:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sagara.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.36,0:18:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The tables have turned, Matsunaga Danjo.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunate.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.30,0:18:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hoped to bring even greater chaos to these times of war.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're just like that assassin?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.44,0:19:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My wish is to burn this whole country to the ground.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.05,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.08,0:19:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I told you the answer was my skin,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.84,0:19:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,would you understand?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.15,0:19:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How long can just five of you fight?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.61,0:19:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than just the five of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.66,0:19:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The "Bontenmaru Wants to Be Like That Too Super-Sword!"
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.29,0:19:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The beast of the apocalypse, Bontenmaru, is here!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.97,0:19:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Takayama Dom Justo shall aide you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.73,0:19:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Konishi Joachin is here as well!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.11,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is your ally in creating a new era!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are all people like me,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,hated and with no place in this country.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.09,0:19:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even missionaries with no weapons.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.25,0:19:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Oda Nobuna's power?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She's different...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.37,0:19:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's different from everyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.98,0:19:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain she can...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.83,0:20:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Matsunaga Danjo Hisahide, surrender myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.99,0:20:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.29,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Several days later,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.00,0:20:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagawa Yoshimoto was officially appointed to her new position.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.74,0:20:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A new order and governing power were established,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.24,0:20:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and Nobuna took another step towards conquering Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have Oda Nobuna rule the country.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when it has a good ruler
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.64,0:20:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,can the nation have a brighter future.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.70,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Himeko.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna is a country count who loves war.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.50,0:20:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know what she may be thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.73,0:20:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that I don't know what's in her heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But the man behind her,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagara Yoshiharu, is a good man.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.64,0:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did this monkey touch you?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.22,0:21:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.65,0:21:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just by touching someone, she can read what's in their heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.74,0:21:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.41,0:21:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sagara Yoshiharu's feelings burn so brightly for her,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna must be a good person as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.94,0:21:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Himeko!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.41,0:21:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yoshiharu likes girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.24,0:21:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,His head was filled with images of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.51,0:21:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna, take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.19,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember that.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.26,0:21:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.09,0:21:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you lead the new regime yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.35,0:21:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass on that.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.97,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want is freedom.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.82,0:21:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to remove the idea of "position" from this country,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.47,0:21:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and show, through my own life,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.57,0:21:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that you can choose your own future.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.62,0:21:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You blaspheme—
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.12,0:22:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you feel that way?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For my dreams!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.65,0:22:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will pray that your dreams come true.
